<title>UK: SuedwestLB unit sets 300 mln Swiss franc 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB unit sets 300 mln Swiss franc 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS LONDON</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    10.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.45    PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
